    {
      "block_id": 7,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "This appendix provides a quick reference of the M68000 family instructions. The organiza-\ntion of this section is by processors and their addressing modes. All references to the\nMC68000, MC68020, and MC68030 include references to the corresponding embedded\ncontrollers, MC68EC000, MC68EC020, and MC68EC030. All references to the MC68040\ninclude the MC68LC040 and MC68EC040. This referencing applies throughout this section\nunless otherwise speciﬁed. Table A-1 lists the M68000 family instructions by mnemonic and\nindicates which processors they apply to. \n",
